- screenshot: Save a screenshot of the current page as evidence (saved under runs/<id>/).
- lookup_vendor: Resolve a vendor name or alias against the vendor list. Reports AMBIGUOUS when several vendors match.
- find_latest_document: Find the latest source document for a vendor. kind: 'invoice' (searches invoice PDFs and emails) or 'po'.
- submit_record: Submit the record on the current page through the policy gate.

